[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13451.75, "timestamp": "03:44:11", "text": "。我當時就想，「我的天哪。」 哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13454.309, "timestamp": "03:44:14", "text": "你也是那種喜歡想像事物的人，為了理解它，你必須在腦海中把它具象化，就像把它想像成現實一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13459.59, "timestamp": "03:44:19", "text": "。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13467.59, "timestamp": "03:44:27", "text": "的。我也是。有時候我需要放慢腳步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13470.309, "timestamp": "03:44:30", "text": "我需要慢慢地去做事情才能理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13474.07, "timestamp": "03:44:34", "text": "它。  嗯。是的，這很棒。  慢，慢。  是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13482.95, "timestamp": "03:44:42", "text": "正如大家所知，今天我像往常一樣非常忙碌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13486.389, "timestamp": "03:44:46", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13488.63, "timestamp": "03:44:48", "text": "是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13491.75, "timestamp": "03:44:51", "text": "。嗯，今天也很熱鬧，因為"}]